<title>VENEZUELA: TABLE - Sivensa Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Sivensa Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shr n/a</p>
<p>Net $15.893 million vs $23.786 million</p>
<p>Sales $214.447 million vs $166.317 million</p>
<p>Cost of sales $165.516 million vs $135.384 million</p>
<p>Oper income $27.339 million vs $12.475 million</p>
<p>Total financing cost $3.790 million loss vs $33.590 million gain</p>
<p>NOTES: Three month period ending June 30</p>
<p>Results are presented according to U.S. accounting procedures</p>
<p>Siderurgica Venezolana (Sivensa SACA) is Venezuela's top private steel company</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
